Package: FESLtelemetry
Type: Package
Title: Publication-Level Acoustic Telemetry Analysis for the Fish Ecology Science Lab
Version: 0.2.1
Date: 2026-05-28
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Paul",
           family = "Bzonek",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "Paul.Bzonek@dfo-mpo.gc.ca")
Description: Post-processing and publication-level analysis tools for acoustic
    telemetry data in the Fish Ecology Science Lab (FESL). Designed as a
    downstream analytical layer for data prepared with the positionRtools
    package. Provides station residency calculations, movement network analysis,
    publication-quality visualizations, and standardized analysis templates.
    Accepts positionRtools atel objects directly, with backwards compatibility
    for plain GLATOS-format dataframes.
URL: https://github.com/FishEcologyScience/FESL_package_telemetry
BugReports: https://github.com/FishEcologyScience/FESL_package_telemetry/issues
